      "text": "Predicted Band - most important\nCoverage: “true close v.s. predicted range capture”\nWidth: \"How wide is the predicted band?\"\nMiss penalty: distance to Truth\n-----------------------------------------------------------\nGOAL: minimize quantile loss (max coverage)",
